message: "If you use this research observatory, please cite the repository or the specific dated weekly brief."
title: "Human Cognition with AI"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Xmemo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xmemo/human-cognition-with-ai"
url: "https://github.com/Xmemo/human-cognition-with-ai"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-28"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual, evidence-first research observatory tracking how AI changes human cognition,
  how human-AI systems can augment cognition, and how these changes propagate through
  machine culture and collective cognition. Dated weekly briefs should be cited by their
  individual Markdown file and underlying primary sources.
keywords:
  - human cognition
  - generative AI
  - cognitive offloading
  - metacognition
  - epistemic agency
  - cognitive augmentation
  - hybrid intelligence
  - machine culture
  - collective cognition
